#. <CLT 4>そこには、夢でも錯覚でもなく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking at her made it painfully clear it wasn't a\n"
"dream, or an illusion.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>変わり果てた彼女が存在していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She had lost everything that made her \"her\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園…さん……
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>涙と、吐き気と、立ちくらみが、
#. ほぼ同時にボクを襲った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All at once I was overcome with dizziness, nausea, the\n"
"urge to burst into tears...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…怯んでいられない……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I can't...I can't hesitate now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、舞園さんが殺されなければ
#. ならなかったのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why...? Why did Sayaka have to die?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…その真相を……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to uncover the truth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>解き明かさなくちゃならないんだッ！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to find out what happened!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>倒れそうなボクの背中を支えてくれたのは、
#. そんな決意だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wanted to give up, I wanted to collapse. But that\n"
"thought held me up and supported me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは舞園さんの背中越しに、
#. 後ろの壁を覗き込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I looked past Sayaka to the wall behind her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And there I saw...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えっ…！？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh—!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>『１１０３７』<CLT><CLT 4>と書かれた赤い文字…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Written in blood were the numbers <CLT><CLT 3>11037<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…舞園さんが残したのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did...Sayaka do this?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは舞園さんの背中越しに、
#. 後ろの壁を覗き込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I looked past Sayaka to the wall behind her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And there I saw...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>『１１０３７』<CLT><CLT 4>と書かれた赤い文字…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Written in blood were the numbers <CLT><CLT 3>11037<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…舞園さんが残したのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did...Sayaka do this?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>正直…直視するのも辛い……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I told myself I simply couldn't face what I saw,\n"
"but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. けど、そんな事…
#. 言ってる場合じゃない…！
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But now's no time to think like that!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、手元のモノクマファイルを元に、
#. 舞園さんの死体状況の確認を始めた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I pulled out the Monokuma File to verify what it said\n"
"about her body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お腹に<CLT 3>刃物<CLT>が刺さってる…
#. これが致命傷か…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Some sort of <CLT 3>sharp object<CLT> has been thrust into her\n"
"stomach. That must've been the killing blow..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、この刃物って……
#. どこから持ってきた物なんだ？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But whatever they used to kill her...\n"
"Where'd they get it?"
msgstr ""

#. 刃物がありそうな場所…
#. 後で、調べておく必要があるかも…
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's definitely something I should look into\n"
"later..."
msgstr ""

#. それと…モノクマファイルによると、
#. 舞園さんは右手首を骨折しているんだよな…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Also according to the Monokuma File, Sayaka's right\n"
"wrist is broken."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、右手首には
#. 腫れと出血があるみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her wrist does look swollen and bloody, that's for\n"
"sure.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、この腫れた部分…
#. 何か“キラキラ光っている物”が付着してる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...there's something sorta glittery there on her\n"
"wrist, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 右手首の腫れ…
#. そこに付着したキラキラ光る物…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Right there, where her wrist is all swollen...there's\n"
"something glittery."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと…気になるな……
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That definitely concerns me..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと…他に気になるのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Another thing that concerns me is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ？　舞園さんの左手…
#. 人差し指だけ血が付いてる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? There's some blood on her left index finger, but\n"
"that's it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>両手とも手の平はキレイなままなのに、
#. 左手の人差し指だけどうして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The palms of both her hands are totally spotless, so\n"
"how come only her left finger...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>舞園の手首<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Sayaka's Wrist<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの致命傷は腹部の刺し傷だから、
#. 右手首を骨折したのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The stab wound in her stomach is what killed her, so\n"
"when she broke her wrist...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それより、以前って事になるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That must have happened earlier on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、死んだ後に骨折する理由なんて、
#. 考えられないからな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, how would her wrist get broken after she'd\n"
"already been killed?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とすると、この傷って、
#. 部屋で争いがあった時に負った傷なのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So it's very possible she broke her wrist during the\n"
"struggle...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人は、部屋で舞園さんに襲い掛かり、
#. そこで舞園さんは手首を骨折させた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer attacked Sayaka in the main room, which is\n"
"when her wrist got broken...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後、舞園さんは、
#. このシャワールームに追いつめられ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After that, the killer cornered her in the bathroom...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…刃物によって致命傷を負わされた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...where they inflicted the deadly wound.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. お腹に<CLT 3>刃物<CLT>が刺さってる…
#. これが致命傷か…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Some sort of <CLT 3>sharp object<CLT> has been thrust into her\n"
"stomach. That must've been the killing blow..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、この刃物って…
#. どこから持ってきた物なんだ？
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But whatever they used to killer her... Where'd they\n"
"get it?"
msgstr ""

#. 刃物がありそうな場所…
#. 後で、調べておく必要がありそうだな。
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's definitely something I should look into\n"
"later..."
msgstr ""

#. それと…モノクマファイルによると、
#. 右手首を骨折しているんだよな…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Also according to the Monokuma File, Sayaka's right\n"
"wrist is broken."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、右手首には
#. 腫れと出血があるみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her wrist does look swollen and bloody, that's for\n"
"sure.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、この腫れた部分…
#. 何か“キラキラ光っている物”が付着しているな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...there's something sorta glittery there on her\n"
"wrist, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 右手首の腫れ…
#. そこに付着したキラキラ光る物…
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Right there, where her wrist is all swollen...there's\n"
"something glittery."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと…気になるな…
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That definitely concerns me..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他に気になるのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Another thing that concerns me is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの左手の
#. 人差し指だけに血が付いてる事だな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's some blood on her left index finger, but\n"
"that's it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>両手とも手の平はキレイなままなのに、
#. 左手の人差し指だけどうして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The palms of both her hands are totally spotless, so\n"
"how come only her left finger...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく、舞園さんの致命傷は
#. 腹部の刺し傷なんだから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The stab wound in her stomach is what killed her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>右手首を骨折したのは、
#. それより以前って事になるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...so when she broke her wrist...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、死んだ後に骨折する理由なんて、
#. 考えられないからな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, how would her wrist get broken after she'd\n"
"already been killed?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とすると、この傷って、
#. 部屋で争いがあった時に負った傷なのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So it's very possible she broke her wrist during the\n"
"struggle...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人は、部屋で舞園さんに襲い掛かり、
#. そこで舞園さんは手首を骨折した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer attacked Sayaka in the main room, which is\n"
"when her wrist got broken...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後、舞園さんは、
#. このシャワールームに追いつめられ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After that, the killer cornered her in the bathroom...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…刃物によって致命傷を負わされた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...where they inflicted the deadly wound.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>このシャワーって…
#. 夜時間は水が出ないんだったよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The water for the showers gets turned off at\n"
"nighttime...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの死体状況の確認をしないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As much as I hate to, I need to check Sayaka's body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0063 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0064 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>シャワールームから出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the bathroom?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
